            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[### Fixed
- **Perch does less work while your agents run.** The menu bar was being redrawn
  five times more often than its text actually changed, and every update reread
  every session file on disk — including hundreds from sessions that ended weeks
  ago. Both are gone. Nothing looks different; there is simply less happening
  behind it.
]]></description>
